WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.280
that goes out there,

00:00:01.280 --> 00:00:04.940
and obviously you as well, sir, and all the staff,

00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:08.860
we are now under that threat every single day.

00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:11.340
And working there at Turning Point USA,

00:00:11.340 --> 00:00:13.100
and I've spent just about the last month

00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:15.180
out there in Phoenix with Erica,

00:00:15.180 --> 00:00:17.260
with the family, with the team.

00:00:17.260 --> 00:00:19.059
And I will tell you this, Mr. President,

00:00:19.059 --> 00:00:20.820
even though going through something like that,

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:23.180
which is an absolute nightmare,

00:00:23.180 --> 00:00:24.219
and people say, you know,

00:00:24.219 --> 00:00:26.860
what was it like to speak in front of all those people?

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:27.700
It was horrible.

00:00:27.700 --> 00:00:29.299
Every second of it was horrible.

